## Description

This function demonstrates tags that have no coverage in any other fixture.

See the paper at [doi:10.1234/example](https://doi.org/10.1234/example) for background.

See [`MyClass-class`](https://rdrr.io/r/base/MyClass-class.html) for the unqualified form and [`methods::envRefClass-class`](https://rdrr.io/pkg/methods/man/envRefClass-class.html) for the qualified form.

As _R Core Team (2024)_ explains, the HTML format is common.

Use [`tags()`](https://rdrr.io/r/base/tags.html) to call this function again, or see [`a qualified pkg:topic link`](https://rdrr.io/pkg/somepkg/man/sometopic.html).

